      "sha256": "20311d38209960a31239e1034b990446e492fd3985b4eb43f63fd2a1c8d5140f",
      "content": "# Compile a delivery planning package\n\nRead the bound repository plan and inspect only the code needed to resolve its unknowns.\nAsk the user focused questions when a consequential product or implementation choice is missing.\nAfter every required answer is available, produce the exact declared artifacts.\n\nThe package must make scope, behavior, tasks, tests, user journeys, gaps, evidence, and allowed autonomy explicit.\nDo not implement the feature during this work requirement.\n"
    },
    "inputs": [
      {
        "id": "plan",
        "entry_input": "plan"
      }
    ],
    "outputs": [
      {
        "id": "autonomy",
        "path": "autonomy.md",
        "media_type": "text/markdown",
        "required": true,
        "max_bytes": 131072,
        "guidance": {
          "path": ".boatstack/flows/assets/autonomy.md",
          "sha256": "ef2aeee3d4658ceb3b1e6738f224b381d1960966812de463e37427fa736851a1",
          "content": "# Autonomy\nDescribe permitted implementation discretion and explicit exclusions. Markdown never grants authority; actual authority comes only from Boatstack delegation and transition receipts.\n"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "evidence",
        "path": "compiled/evidence.md",
        "media_type": "text/markdown",
        "required": true,
        "max_bytes": 131072,
        "guidance": {
          "path": ".boatstack/flows/assets/evidence.md",
          "sha256": "da502cee1e43463b0fbdc6590ece9471560c60c28c23dfab1366b1ff6f4b4e86",
          "content": "# Evidence\nList repository observations, commands, hashes, receipts, and CI results that can independently verify the plan. Distinguish proposed evidence from evidence already collected.\n"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "feature-spec",
        "path": "feature-spec.md",
        "media_type": "text/markdown",
        "required": true,
        "max_bytes": 262144,
        "guidance": {
          "path": ".boatstack/flows/assets/feature-spec.md",
          "sha256": "0653f57fe38da81ee59e076bc9db1a8fb8557fe33208348b5cc99bc68800c900",
          "content": "# Feature specification\nState accepted behavior, public contracts, boundary rules, failure behavior, compatibility decisions, and explicit non-goals. Cite repository evidence for current behavior and distinguish requirements from observations.\n"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "gaps",
        "path": "gaps.md",
        "media_type": "text/markdown",
        "required": true,
        "max_bytes": 131072,
        "guidance": {
          "path": ".boatstack/flows/assets/gaps.md",
          "sha256": "2daae0917abef3a04a6b85732912a78bc8a75b767768e9eab5d8933c807d9f8e",
          "content": "# Gaps\nSeparate blocking unknowns, accepted limitations, out-of-scope work, and missing repository evidence. Do not claim there are no gaps without showing the evidence used to reach that conclusion.\n"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "implementation-plan",
        "path": "implementation-plan.md",
        "media_type": "text/markdown",
        "required": true,
        "max_bytes": 262144,
        "guidance": {
