          "sha256": "dcee245bc7ccc59f0426b4094e4773463c89df2c38aac9a253142878cb7f2173",
          "content": "# Implementation plan\nDefine ordered, decision-complete implementation slices with owning boundaries, exact files or interfaces, dependencies, verification, and completion criteria. Keep the plan consistent with the feature specification and do not implement during planning.\n"
        }
      },
